{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484206,"name":"Bradley Street","username":"Bradley_Street","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/bradley_street/{size}/120126_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T19:24:46.148Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484206-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484206-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484206-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484206-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003cbr\u003e\nOn Grok Bot for Mac, bot replies do not show in the main chat pane. They do appear in the left preview pane and on the iOS app. Recreated the bot and restarted the work; same behavior returned — replies still only in left preview + iOS, not the main Mac chat pane.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChat / agent id: b8f034e6-9546-4407-b7c5-fdf079b0356a\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Mac.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the affected agent chat and send a message (or wait for a reply).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve: reply missing from main chat pane.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve: same reply visible in left preview pane and on iOS.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecreate bot / start over — issue returns after a little while.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpected Behavior\u003cbr\u003e\nReplies render in the main Mac chat pane (same as iOS / preview).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOperating System\u003cbr\u003e\nmacOS (Grok Bot for Mac)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor?\u003cbr\u003e\nNo — Cursor works; this is Grok Bot Mac UI only.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484206-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484206-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Mac.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the affected agent chat and send a message (or wait for a reply).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve: reply missing from main chat pane.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve: same reply visible in left preview pane and on iOS.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecreate bot / start over — issue returns after a little while.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484206-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484206-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResponses should show in main chat.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484206-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484206-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484206-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484206-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrokbot for Mac 0.43.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484206-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484206-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-05T19:51:52.223Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":13,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":61.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170721,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-mac-replies-missing-in-main-chat-pane-visible-in-left-preview-ios","display_username":"Bradley Street","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135272,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-mac-replies-missing-in-main-chat-pane-visible-in-left-preview-ios/170721/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":484214,"name":"Bradley Street","username":"Bradley_Street","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/bradley_street/{size}/120126_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T19:46:49.185Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI am now getting the issue on a separate account and totally different Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth Macs running the latest stable release.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChat ID: ca40d07f-c9b8-4b7e-bb01-64bbe4c24f19\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-05T19:46:49.185Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170721,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-mac-replies-missing-in-main-chat-pane-visible-in-left-preview-ios","display_username":"Bradley Street","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135272,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-mac-replies-missing-in-main-chat-pane-visible-in-left-preview-ios/170721/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":484500,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T11:29:03.398Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report and for the second chat ID.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBased on what you described, the bot is receiving and processing your messages. That’s why the replies show up on iPhone and in the sidebar preview. The issue is with the current Mac app version 0.43.0. The main chat panel stops getting live updates for the conversation, so your messages end up looking like they weren’t delivered, and the replies don’t appear in the main window. This isn’t related to your setup, and it’s the same root cause on both Macs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDon’t do a Reset or Restore for the bot computer and don’t reinstall the app. It won’t help and you’ll just waste time. Recreating the bot doesn’t fix it either, as you already saw.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a known issue and we’re tracking it. I can’t share an exact timeline yet, but I’ll reply in this thread when there’s an update. For now, the iPhone app shows these chats reliably, and other bots on Mac that aren’t affected yet should still work normally.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_c